 * Two changes from the listing as printed in the PDF:
 *   1. DUMMY_SIZE is set per sandbox instance by the APG "dummy_size"
 *      variable, instead of a single instructor-chosen -D flag shared by
 *      a whole class.
 *   2. The secret message is this sandbox's "flag_task4" APG value
 *      instead of a string fixed for every student.
 *   3. The PDF's listing calls a helper() function in main() that is
 *      never defined in the printed excerpt - it's stubbed out here as a
 *      no-op so the file compiles.
 *   4. Added #include <stdint.h> for uintptr_t, missing from the
 *      listing's own header list - it compiled without it on whatever
 *      system the PDF's screenshots were taken on, but not here.
 * See ATTRIBUTION.txt.
